{"seq":2,"slug":"endorsement-transfer-surrender-mechanics","title":"eBL 背书转让与注销的原子操作与并发控制","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/electronic-bill-of-lading-trade-document-digitization/ebl-issuance-transfer-surrender-platform/endorsement-transfer-surrender-mechanics","wordCount":2739,"readingTime":11,"html":"<h1 id=\"ebl-背书转让与注销的原子操作与并发控制\">eBL 背书转让与注销的原子操作与并发控制</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念-背书是追加交易-不是改字段\">核心概念：背书是追加交易，不是改字段</h2><p>把 eBL 的转让实现成 <code>UPDATE documents SET holder = ? WHERE id = ?</code>，是这一类系统最典型的架构错误。DCSA eBL v3 把背书（endorsement）、转让（transfer）、注销（surrender）都建模为<strong>追加式交易</strong>：每次流转在 <code>envelopeTransferChain</code> 或 <code>endorsementChain</code> 末尾追加一条带签名的记录，而不是原地覆盖&quot;当前持有人&quot;字段。\n这条设计选择的直接后果是：<strong>一次流转的原子性等于&quot;追加且仅追加一次&quot;</strong>，而不是&quot;把某一列改成新值&quot;。规范对 <code>EndorsementChainLink</code> 的必填字段定义得很死——<code>actionDateTime</code>、<code>actionCode</code>、<code>actor</code>、<code>recipient</code>（<a href=\"https://github.com/dcsaorg/DCSA-OpenAPI/tree/master/ebl/v3/endorsement\">DCSA eBL Endorsement API v3.0.4</a>）。<code>actionDateTime</code> 是签名载荷的一部分，缺失就无法参与哈希链；<code>actor</code> 缺失则事后无法证明&quot;是谁行使了控制权&quot;。这两点决定了不能用可变行模拟链。</p>\n<p>九个 <code>actionCode</code> 里真正具有转让语义的只有 <code>ENDORSE</code>、<code>ENDORSE_TO_ORDER</code>、<code>BLANK_ENDORSE</code>、<code>TRANSFER</code>，其余是确认或注销类动作。<code>ENDORSE</code> 系列受 <code>isToOrder=true</code> 门控——<strong>记名单上做背书在法律上自相矛盾</strong>，平台必须在写路径拦截，而非前端置灰按钮；它是业务不变量，必须落在拥有该聚合的写端。这套法律功能为什么能映射为技术控制，见同 hub 的<a href=\"../bill-of-lading-legal-electronic-model/bol-three-legal-functions-transferability\">提单三大法律功能与可转让性建模</a>。</p>\n<p>一个容易被忽略的接口事实：<strong>背书链在 DCSA v3 里没有&quot;写&quot;端点</strong>，只有一个只读查询 <code>GET /endorsement-chains/{transportDocumentReference}</code>，且不支持分页。背书动作本身发生在平台的控制权转移路径里（同平台内是平台自有 API，跨平台是 PINT 信封），查询端点只负责事后举证。</p>\n<h2 id=\"并发三害-双背书-重复注销-重复应答\">并发三害：双背书、重复注销、重复应答</h2><p>eBL 领域的并发缺陷不是泛泛的&quot;竞态&quot;，而是三种有名字、有 API 表现的损失场景。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    P[唯一占有人] --&gt;|并发发起两个流转| A1[动作A:背书给 B]&#10;    P --&gt;|并发发起两个流转| A2[动作B:背书给 C]&#10;    A1 --&gt; S1[两个环节都追加到链尾]&#10;    A2 --&gt; S1&#10;    S1 --&gt; D{链头校验和&lt;br/&gt;一致吗}&#10;    D --&gt;|乐观并发失配| CF[拒绝其一&lt;br/&gt;DISE 链冲突]&#10;    D --&gt;|未做校验| DS[同一 eBL 出现两条平行持仓]&#10;    DS --&gt; L[双重提货&lt;br/&gt;double-spend]\">graph TD\n    P[唯一占有人] --&gt;|并发发起两个流转| A1[动作A:背书给 B]\n    P --&gt;|并发发起两个流转| A2[动作B:背书给 C]\n    A1 --&gt; S1[两个环节都追加到链尾]\n    A2 --&gt; S1\n    S1 --&gt; D{链头校验和&lt;br/&gt;一致吗}\n    D --&gt;|乐观并发失配| CF[拒绝其一&lt;br/&gt;DISE 链冲突]\n    D --&gt;|未做校验| DS[同一 eBL 出现两条平行持仓]\n    DS --&gt; L[双重提货&lt;br/&gt;double-spend]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>并发冲突</th>\n<th>触发场景</th>\n<th>API 表现</th>\n<th>正确对策</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>双背书 / 双转让</td>\n<td>同一占有人并发发起两次流转</td>\n<td>跨平台返回 <code>DISE</code>（链争议或疑似双花）</td>\n<td>链头校验和做乐观并发；CTR 仲裁</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>重复注销请求</td>\n<td>持有人重试 <code>POST /v3/ebl-surrender-requests</code></td>\n<td><code>surrenderRequestReference</code> <strong>不得重用</strong>，重放无法被识别为同一请求</td>\n<td>客户端持久化引用；重试前先查裁决</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>重复应答注销</td>\n<td>承运人对同一请求应答两次</td>\n<td><code>POST /v3/ebl-surrender-responses</code> 返回 <code>409 Conflict</code></td>\n<td>应答前先落库终态；把 409 当幂等成功</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>重复投递同一信封</td>\n<td>PINT 发送方超时后重发</td>\n<td><code>DUPE</code>（仅在链环节签名校验和完全一致时要求检测到）</td>\n<td>复用同一份已签名字节重发</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>中途文档缺失</td>\n<td><code>finish-transfer</code> 前文档未齐</td>\n<td><code>MDOC</code> + <code>missingAdditionalDocumentChecksums</code></td>\n<td>补齐后重试 finish，不重开信封</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>最值得警惕的是 <code>DISE</code>。规范把&quot;链争议或可能的双花&quot;的<strong>检测</strong>标记为实现相关，<strong>解决</strong>则在 API 之外进行（out-of-band resolution）——API 只把冲突暴露成可举证的证据，不做业务裁决。但供应链金融的后果极重：一张 eBL 被平行转让给两家银行就是一次融资欺诈。平台侧除链校验外，还需速度风控（同一承运人/港口在极短窗口内的多次流转告警）与提货环节交叉核对（见同 hub 的<a href=\"../bill-of-lading-legal-electronic-model/single-control-conflict-fraud-dispute\">单一控制权、冲突与欺诈争议</a>）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"用链头校验和做乐观并发控制\">用链头校验和做乐观并发控制</h2><p>既然历史是追加式哈希链，最自然的并发控制就是<strong>把链头摘要当版本号</strong>。设第 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span> 条环节的规范形式为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi></mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>L</mi><mi>k</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathrm{canon}(L_k)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">canon</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>（RFC 8785 JSON 规范化后再序列化），则链的不变量是：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>H</mi><mi>k</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">S</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi><mn>256</mn></mrow><mo fence=\"true\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.2em\" maxsize=\"1.2em\">(</mo><msub><mi>H</mi><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>∥</mo><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi></mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>L</mi><mi>k</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo fence=\"true\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.2em\" maxsize=\"1.2em\">)</mo><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"1em\"/><msub><mi>H</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">S</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi><mn>256</mn></mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mtext mathvariant=\"monospace\">ISSUE</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">H_k = \\mathrm{SHA256}\\bigl(H_{k-1} \\parallel \\mathrm{canon}(L_k)\\bigr), \\quad H_0 = \\mathrm{SHA256}(\\texttt{ISSUE})</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0813em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2em;vertical-align:-0.35em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">SHA256</span></span><span class=\"mopen\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">(</span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0813em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2083em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∥</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2em;vertical-align:-0.35em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">canon</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mclose\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">)</span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0813em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">SHA256</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord texttt\">ISSUE</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>一次追加在逻辑上等价于一次 CAS（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">v</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">f</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathrm{verify}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\" style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">verify</span></span></span></span></span></span> 是对环节 JWS 的密码学校验）：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">p</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">p</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi></mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>L</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mtext>  </mtext><mo>⟺</mo><mtext>  </mtext><msub><mi>H</mi><mtext>head</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>H</mi><mtext>expected</mtext></msub><mtext>  </mtext><mo>∧</mo><mtext>  </mtext><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">v</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">f</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi></mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi></mrow><mi>L</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">⊤</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathrm{append}(L) \\iff H_{\\text{head}} = H_{\\text{expected}} \\;\\wedge\\; \\mathrm{verify}(\\mathrm{sig}_L) = \\top</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">append</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">⟺</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0813em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">head</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0813em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">expected</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">∧</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\" style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">verify</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\" style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">sig</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2342em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4559em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">L</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2441em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">⊤</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>PINT 规范对接收方的校验顺序给出硬性步骤：先校验运输单证校验和与签名清单一致，再校验最后一条链环节的校验和与清单一致，然后<strong>沿链反向逐条验证</strong>，最后确认第一条以 <code>ISSUE</code> 事务开头；顺序错乱可能被判为 <code>BENV</code>（不可接受的信封）。\n这套方案对工程实现的三个要求：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>校验和必须在规范化之后计算。</strong> 键序或空白差异会让摘要永远对不上，这是 422/403 报错最常见的根因。</li>\n<li><strong>不要引入&quot;当前持有人&quot;可变列作为真相源。</strong> 它可作为读模型加速查询，但真相永远是链；一旦漂移，以链为准并重建投影。</li>\n<li><strong>期望链头要随请求携带。</strong> 没有 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>H</mi><mtext>expected</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">H_{\\text{expected}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0813em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">expected</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 的追加请求就是盲写，服务端无法判断是否与并发写冲突。</li>\n</ol>\n<p>这是<strong>无锁乐观并发</strong>加<strong>只追加日志</strong>，不是悲观锁：天然可审计、可跨机构验签，代价是冲突后须由业务层重试或人工介入——几个不同公司、不同平台之间没有共享的锁管理器。</p>\n<h2 id=\"注销的双相模型-冻结窗口与单次应答\">注销的双相模型：冻结窗口与单次应答</h2><p>注销是整个生命周期里并发语义最重的环节，因为它把&quot;控制权&quot;从持有人手里交回承运人，并且不可逆。DCSA 用严格的<strong>请求-应答双相模型</strong>实现：平台代表持有人 <code>POST /v3/ebl-surrender-requests</code>，载荷 <code>SurrenderRequestDetails</code> 含 <code>surrenderRequestReference</code>、<code>transportDocumentReference</code>、<code>surrenderRequestCode</code>，成功返回 <code>204</code>（<a href=\"https://github.com/dcsaorg/DCSA-OpenAPI/tree/master/ebl/v3/surrender\">DCSA eBL Surrender API</a>）；承运人之后 <code>POST /v3/ebl-surrender-responses</code> 提交 <code>SurrenderRequestAnswer</code>，其 <code>action</code> 只有两个值：<code>SURR</code>（接受，承运人取得占有并可作废该单）与 <code>SREJ</code>（拒绝，eBL 退回提交方）。</p>\n<p><code>204</code> 只是&quot;登记已接受&quot;，<strong>不是结果</strong>。这带来一个关键并发窗口：从请求提交到承运人应答之间，规范要求承运人<strong>持续持有该 eBL 的占有权</strong>——等价于纸质流程里把正本提单同步交回承运人柜台的那段时间，本单被&quot;冻结&quot;，不能再背书流转。工程上必须显式实现该状态（如 <code>PENDING_SURRENDER_FOR_DELIVERY</code>），并当作写路径前置条件：冻结窗口内任何背书或转让请求一律拒绝。</p>\n<p>两个请求码 <code>SREQ</code>（交付注销）/ <code>AREQ</code>（修正注销）与原因码 <code>SWTP</code>（换纸质）的组合揭示另一个约定：<strong>&quot;换纸质&quot;被当作修正处理</strong>（<code>AREQ</code> + <code>reasonCode=SWTP</code>）——回到纸质意味着原电子单作废、重新签发纸质正本，与&quot;作废 + 重新签发&quot;完全同构。</p>\n<p>原子性约束在这里最紧：规范明文&quot;承运人对同一注销请求只能应答一次&quot;，重复应答必须 <code>409 Conflict</code>。推荐姿势是应答处理器以 <code>surrenderRequestReference</code> 为幂等键，在<strong>一个事务内</strong>完成&quot;检查状态 → 转换到终态 → 落库&quot;，若该键已处于终态则直接返回 <code>409</code>，<strong>不再</strong>执行转换；客户端把 <code>409</code> 当作&quot;之前的请求已经成功&quot;，而非失败重试。<code>SURR</code> 之后状态机进入不可再交易状态：PINT 明确&quot;在 <code>SACC</code>（注销接受）之后不允许再有任何交易&quot;，终态必须在数据层强制，不能只写在文档里。</p>\n<h2 id=\"跨平台场景-ctr-才是唯一的线性化点\">跨平台场景：CTR 才是唯一的线性化点</h2><p>同一平台内，一次流转的原子性由该平台的单写者保证。<strong>跨平台</strong>时问题立刻升级：两家平台各自记录&quot;我持有这张 eBL&quot;，网络分区或双花就不可避免。DCSA 的答案是引入 <strong>Control Tracking Registry（CTR）</strong>。</p>\n<p>PINT 规范对 CTR 的措辞很强硬：登记控制权的 CTR 是**&quot;最终仲裁者&quot;**（final arbiter）；所有受其管辖的流转都必须在 CTR 中记录，未记录的流转无效且必须被拒绝；即使 PINT 的应答缺失、未签名、报错或与 CTR 冲突，<strong>CTR 的接受结果依然优先</strong>。规范甚至直言在冲突时&quot;PINT 层的信息充其量只是参考&quot;（advisory at best）。</p>\n<p>这句话对架构建模的意义是：<strong>CTR 就是整个跨平台 eBL 体系的线性化点。</strong> 其他所有组件（PINT 信封、平台本地库、通知）都退化为可重放的复制品。工程结论直白：发送方可<strong>不等待</strong>签名的 PINT 应答就取消一次受 CTR 保护的流转；接收方应先查 CTR 的当前控制方，再决定是否接受信封；平台本地状态一旦与 CTR 不一致，<strong>必须</strong>以 CTR 为准重建，而不是尝试&quot;合并&quot;两边。这是 leader-based 复制，不是 multi-master 同步。</p>\n<p>跨平台流转还有一个反直觉的语义细节：普通 <code>TRANSFER</code> 通过信封投递<strong>转移占有</strong>，但跨平台的 <code>ENDORSE</code>、<code>ENDORSE_TO_ORDER</code> 与 <code>SACC</code> 投递<strong>只是通知</strong>，规范明说&quot;does NOT result in the transfer of possession&quot;。背书与占有转移在跨平台语境下是可分离的两个事件，假设&quot;背书必然伴随占有转移&quot;就会写出错误的状态迁移；占有人/权利人（title-holder）的区分在 API 里甚至没有被显式建模，只能从交易类型、actor 与 recipient 推断——这正是平台需要在内部保留一份读模型的原因。</p>\n<p>互联拓扑决定集成成本。若平台两两约定互联，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span> 家平台的链路数是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><mfrac linethickness=\"0px\"><mi>n</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>2</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\binom{n}{2} = n(n-1)/2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2em;vertical-align:-0.35em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">(</span></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7454em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.355em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.144em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.345em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">)</span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mord\">/2</span></span></span></span></span>，即 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msup><mi>n</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(n^2)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0641em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>；DCSA 统一 API 加 PINT 信封的目的就是把它压成 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(n)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 枢纽。因此 <code>eblPlatform</code>、<code>sendToPlatform</code> 都是<strong>路由信息</strong>；而 <code>partyCode</code> 跨平台不通用，识别当事人必须靠代码对（<code>codeListProvider</code> + <code>partyCode</code>）——对方用 PartyCode 校验收件人，不认识的收件人一律拒绝。</p>\n<p>最后一层的并发控制不是&quot;防两个用户同时点按钮&quot;，而是&quot;进程发送后崩溃了怎么办&quot;，两条规则必须写进代码。<strong>重试复用同一份已签名字节，不要重新签名</strong>：PINT 规定 <code>DUPE</code> 的检测&quot;仅在链环节签名内容的校验和完全一致时才要求&quot;（同一 <code>EnvelopeTransferChainEntrySignedContentChecksum</code>），而该载荷含 <code>actionDateTime</code>，超时后重签会让时间戳与校验和都变，接收方无法认定这是重放，可能产生第二条平行交易；正确做法是首次发送<strong>之前</strong>就把签名字节持久化。<strong>只有签名的应答才可作为最终结论</strong>：未签名的错误（含中间件错误）都不可靠，签名的完成应答里 <code>responseCode</code> 优先于 HTTP 状态码；<code>INCD</code>/<code>MDOC</code> 不构成拒绝（补齐后重试），<code>BSIG</code>/<code>BENV</code> 是拒绝（转人工，不可自动重试），<code>DISE</code> 是冲突（走线下解决），而 <code>RECE</code> 与 <code>DUPE</code> 都应视为成功。把这三类合并成一个 <code>try/catch</code> 统一重试，正是双花与重复提单的常见来源。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>eBL 的背书、转让与注销在工程上是一套<strong>只追加 + 乐观并发 + 单一仲裁者</strong>的分布式状态机：原子单位是&quot;向链尾追加一条已签名交易&quot;，并发控制靠链头校验和做 CAS，冲突通过 <code>DISE</code> 暴露而非被 API 消除；注销用双相模型加&quot;冻结窗口&quot;实现不可逆转换，用 <code>409 Conflict</code> 保证单次应答；跨平台时唯一的线性化点是 CTR。随着 DCSA 推动&quot;2030 年 100% eBL&quot;（<a href=\"https://dcsa.org/standards/ebill-of-lading/\">DCSA eBL 标准页</a>），上述并发语义会越来越多地跨越机构边界。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"eBL 背书转让与注销的原子操作与并发控制","id":"ebl-背书转让与注销的原子操作与并发控制"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：背书是追加交易，不是改字段","id":"核心概念-背书是追加交易-不是改字段"},{"level":2,"text":"并发三害：双背书、重复注销、重复应答","id":"并发三害-双背书-重复注销-重复应答"},{"level":2,"text":"用链头校验和做乐观并发控制","id":"用链头校验和做乐观并发控制"},{"level":2,"text":"注销的双相模型：冻结窗口与单次应答","id":"注销的双相模型-冻结窗口与单次应答"},{"level":2,"text":"跨平台场景：CTR 才是唯一的线性化点","id":"跨平台场景-ctr-才是唯一的线性化点"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"eBL 签发数据模型与单证生命周期状态机","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/electronic-bill-of-lading-trade-document-digitization/ebl-issuance-transfer-surrender-platform/ebl-issuance-data-model-lifecycle"},"next":{"title":"eBL 平台对接承运人/银行、密钥托管与遗失恢复","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/electronic-bill-of-lading-trade-document-digitization/ebl-issuance-transfer-surrender-platform/platform-integration-key-custody-recovery"}}